/* Change for MicroPython: exclude gc.c, vm.c, parse.c, libc and the newlib mem*
   objects from flash so their .text is placed in SRAM (via the default .data
   section). Keeps the SDK's libgcc and libm exclusions.
   libc.a only matches on RISC-V; Arm builds resolve newlib from libg.a. */
*(EXCLUDE_FILE(*libgcc.a: *libc.a: *lib*_a-mem*.o *libm.a: *py/gc.c.o *py/vm.c.o *py/parse.c.o) .text*)
